{"text": "大后天到，别急", "frames": [{"act": "promise_time", "pol": "+", "when": "friday"}], "tags": ["fluent"], "note": ""}
{"text": "最迟周一到，货今天已经出了", "frames": [{"act": "promise_time", "pol": "+", "when": "monday"}, {"act": "resend", "pol": "+", "when": "today"}], "tags": ["fluent"], "note": ""}
{"text": "您说“不赔钱就差评”，这个我们理解", "frames": [{"act": "none", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["quote"], "note": ""}
{"text": "您问为什么晚？因为快递爆仓", "frames": [{"act": "cause", "pol": "+", "reason": "logistics"}], "tags": ["quote"], "note": ""}
{"text": "不是没发，是快递没揽收", "frames": [{"act": "cause", "pol": "+", "reason": "logistics"}], "tags": ["negation"], "note": ""}
{"text": "我不是说不补偿您，红包马上给", "frames": [{"act": "compensate", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["negation"], "note": ""}
{"text": "谁说我们不发的，今天就重新寄", "frames": [{"act": "resend", "pol": "+", "when": "today"}], "tags": ["negation"], "note": ""}
{"text": "不是不能加急，是加急要加钱", "frames": [{"act": "expedite", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["negation", "conditional"], "note": ""}
{"text": "对不起，要是能早点发就好了，我们也想", "frames": [{"act": "apologize", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["hypothetical"], "note": ""}
{"text": "兄弟，抱歉，真没辙了", "frames": [{"act": "apologize", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["fluent"], "note": ""}
{"text": "咱就是个小店，不容易，您多包涵", "frames": [{"act": "none", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["fluent"], "note": ""}
{"text": "您是想退款还是想等？", "frames": [{"act": "none", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["question"], "note": ""}
{"text": "请问您几号要？", "frames": [{"act": "ask_deadline", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["question"], "note": ""}
{"text": "订单信息发我看看，哪个单子", "frames": [{"act": "ask_order", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["fluent"], "note": ""}
{"text": "在，亲，请讲", "frames": [{"act": "greet", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["fluent"], "note": ""}
{"text": "谅解一下，再宽限两天", "frames": [{"act": "apologize", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["fluent"], "note": ""}
{"text": "打个九折赔您，再免运费", "frames": [{"act": "discount", "pol": "+", "pct": 10}, {"act": "compensate", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["fluent"], "note": ""}
{"text": "实在抱歉，货明天补，红包也给您", "frames": [{"act": "apologize", "pol": "+"}, {"act": "resend", "pol": "+", "when": "tomorrow"}, {"act": "compensate", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["fluent"], "note": ""}
{"text": "嗯，行，你说怎么办就怎么办", "frames": [{"act": "agree", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["fluent"], "note": ""}
{"text": "辛苦您了，感谢，回头再聊", "frames": [{"act": "thanks", "pol": "+"}, {"act": "closing", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["fluent"], "note": ""}
{"text": "这周六晚上，肯定能收到，信我", "frames": [{"act": "promise_time", "pol": "+", "when": "saturday"}], "tags": ["fluent"], "note": ""}
{"text": "不用谢，应该的", "frames": [{"act": "none", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["fluent"], "note": ""}
